      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KEAYANG BAZLENKA (4) hasn't raced since breaking in the NSW Derby in May but was terrific in recording a string of big wins late last season including both the Vicbred and Breeders Crown finals at this circuit and distance. Readied with a trial win and with manners will be tough to stop. HOWDY MATE (1) did a good job for fourth from a tough second row draw in the Holmfield last start. Had good form prior including back-to-back wins at this circuit and distance and he should get his chance from the inside draw. THE PREACHER (2) wasn't far behind HOWDY MATE in the Holmfield where he too started on the back lime. Led for an easy fresh win here prior so can take advantage of a much better draw. SUPERIOR STRIDE (6) may need a touch of luck from this barrier but must be respected after scoring last start by a neck at Menangle.",
